codex
A bounded residual exposed the real cost center: each circularity match was comparing the entire expanded `minPath` closure and builtins map, even though the result loop cannot touch either. I’m framing those preserved global scopes in the loop claims, exactly as the already-proven scan claims do. This is footprint-preserving and makes the match depend only on the counter, result reference, and heap value.
apply patch
